  "ruleText": "Gen 403.03 Application After Revocation of License. An individual whose license was revoked and who wishes to obtain a license shall apply pursuant to Plc 312.05.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25; 10-7-35",
